  },
  {
    "path": "programParticipate.rhythmTitle",
    "v": "Namsan Rhythm Challenge"
  },
  {
    "path": "programParticipate.rhythmLead",
    "v": "A lively mask dance session at Namsan!"
  },
  {
    "path": "programParticipate.rhythmDesc",
    "v": "With Yeonhuijeomchuri, put on a mask and learn talchum to our rhythm.\nEasy, exciting beats and moves anyone can follow—even beginners.\nNot just watching—dance along and enjoy this interactive moment together.\nFeel the joy and spirit of Korean tradition at Namsan!"
  },
