    "v": "Meet BENTON, a K-beauty brand for healthy skin, at Namsan!"
  },
  {
    "path": "sponsorPage.bentonDesc",
    "v": "Inspired by the film The Curious Case of Benjamin Button, Benton is a skincare brand that aims to turn back time for your skin and restore its natural health.\nFrom planning onward, we exclude controversial harmful ingredients and insist on outstanding natural ingredients such as aloe and snail mucin, offering gentle products even sensitive skin can trust.\nWe are certified Cruelty-Free against animal testing and actively use eco-friendly packaging—practicing kind clean beauty that cares for both skin and the planet."
  },
  {
    "path": "sponsorPage.bentonEventTitle",
    "v": "BENTON × ON Festa SNS EVENT"
  },
  {
    "path": "sponsorPage.bentonEventDesc",
    "v": "Try the product on site and follow BENTON’s official Instagram!\nPost a photo of yourself using the product, tag @bentoncosmetic, and add #GlowOnNamsan to enter.\nThe first 20 participants will receive a full-size BENTON product."
  },
  {
    "path": "sponsorPage.bentonClosing",
    "v": "K-BEAUTY EXPERIENCE at Namsan!\nSee, try, and share—complete your special Seoul moment with BENTON."
  },
  {
    "path": "sponsorPage.hikeLogoMain",
    "v": "HIKE SEOUL"
  },
  {
    "path": "sponsorPage.hikeLogoSub",
    "v": "Seoul Urban Hiking"
  },
  {
    "path": "sponsorPage.hikeLogoAlt",
    "v": "HIKE SEOUL"
  },
  {
    "path": "sponsorPage.hikeLead",
    "v": "A new way to explore Seoul’s mountains—SEOUL HIKING"
  },
  {
    "path": "sponsorPage.hikeDesc",
    "v": "The Seoul Hiking Tourism Center connects Seoul’s beautiful mountains with the city, helping visitors enjoy hiking culture with ease.\nFrom hiking information and gear rental to experience programs, it presents Seoul’s trails as unique urban tourism content."
  },
  {
    "path": "sponsorPage.hikeSubLead",
    "v": "Special K-HIKING at Namsan"
  },
  {
    "path": "sponsorPage.hikeEventDesc",
    "v": "At the 2026 Seoul Tourism ON Festa, enjoy a special K-HIKING experience with the Seoul Hiking Tourism Center.\nTry jackets, hats, backpacks, trekking poles, and more to create your K-HIKING LOOK, then capture the moment at Namsan’s summit. Apply the HIKE SEOUL photo frame to keep your Seoul hiking memory."
  },
  {
    "path": "sponsorPage.hikeClosing",
    "v": "A new Seoul journey where city and nature meet—\nexperience SEOUL HIKING at Namsan!"
  },
