    "path": "faq.q1",
    "v": "Is there an admission fee?"
  },
  {
    "path": "faq.a1",
    "v": "There is no admission fee—you can join for free.\nPerformances and on-site experience programs are also free."
  },
  {
    "path": "faq.q2",
    "v": "Is parking available?"
  },
  {
    "path": "faq.a2",
    "v": "General vehicles cannot enter or park at the Namsan summit venue.\nWe recommend public transit or the Namsan Cable Car."
  },
  {
    "path": "faq.q3",
    "v": "Will the event run in rain?"
  },
  {
    "path": "faq.a3",
    "v": "Light rain: the festival is expected to proceed as scheduled.\nStrong wind, heavy rain, or similar conditions may change or cancel some programs; updates will be posted on the website."
  },
  {
    "path": "privacyPage.pageTitle",
    "v": "Privacy Policy"
  },
  {
    "path": "privacyPage.lead",
    "v": "2026 Seoul Tourism ON Festa (the “Event”) complies with applicable privacy laws and publishes this Privacy Policy to protect participants’ personal information."
  },
  {
    "path": "privacyPage.s1Title",
    "v": "1. Purpose of processing"
  },
  {
    "path": "privacyPage.s1Body",
    "v": "We process personal information for the purposes below. Information is not used beyond these purposes; if purposes change, we obtain consent as required by law."
  },
  {
    "path": "privacyPage.s1Item1",
    "v": "Event registration and identity verification"
  },
  {
    "path": "privacyPage.s1Item2",
    "v": "Stamp tours, prizes, souvenirs, and other event operations"
  },
  {
    "path": "privacyPage.s1Item3",
    "v": "Event notices, inquiries, and communications"
  },
  {
    "path": "privacyPage.s1Item4",
    "v": "Operations, safety, and statistical analysis"
  },
  {
    "path": "privacyPage.s2Title",
    "v": "2. Items collected"
  },
  {
    "path": "privacyPage.s2Body",
    "v": "We collect the minimum information needed; items may vary by program or event."
  },
  {
    "path": "privacyPage.s2Item1",
    "v": "Required: name, contact number"
  },
  {
    "path": "privacyPage.s2Item2",
    "v": "Optional: email, nationality, program participation details"
  },
  {
    "path": "privacyPage.s2Item3",
    "v": "Automatic: access logs, cookies, IP address (when using the website)"
  },
  {
    "path": "privacyPage.s3Title",
    "v": "3. Retention period"
  },
  {
    "path": "privacyPage.s3Body",
    "v": "We destroy personal information without delay when the purpose is fulfilled, except where retention is required by law."
  },
  {
    "path": "privacyPage.s4Title",
    "v": "4. Provision to third parties"
  },
  {
    "path": "privacyPage.s4Body",
    "v": "We do not provide personal information to third parties except with prior consent or as required by law."
  },
  {
    "path": "privacyPage.s5Title",
    "v": "5. Processing consignment"
  },
  {
    "path": "privacyPage.s5Body",
    "v": "If we entrust processing to a third party, we disclose the delegate and tasks and protect data under applicable law and contracts."
  },
  {
    "path": "privacyPage.s6Title",
    "v": "6. Your rights"
  },
  {
    "path": "privacyPage.s6Body",
    "v": "You may request access, correction, deletion, or suspension of processing. Contact the officer below; we will respond promptly."
  },
  {
    "path": "privacyPage.s7Title",
    "v": "7. Privacy officer"
  },
  {
    "path": "privacyPage.s7Body",
    "v": "For complaints and remedies regarding personal information, contact:"
  },
  {
    "path": "privacyPage.s7Item1",
    "v": "Office: 2026 Seoul Tourism ON Festa Operations"
  },
  {
    "path": "privacyPage.s7Item2",
    "v": "Phone: +82-2-2600-6455"
  },
  {
    "path": "privacyPage.s8Title",
    "v": "8. Changes to this policy"
  },
  {
    "path": "privacyPage.s8Body",
    "v": "We may update this policy and will post changes on the website."
  },
